Z||000064||BBBAD GT||11-04-2001||08:13 AM||||FWIW, I wouldn't trade my centrifugal blower on the 5.0 for anything.  The other two positive displacement blowers available (autorotor and eaton) would max out about 100 hp less.  It all comes down to what kind of power you want.<P>84 Fiero V8 *Sold*<BR>89 Blown Mustang 5.0<BR>86 Turbo Mustang SVO<P>||||reg||1
